<section class="fragment-plan" data-artifact="plan" data-slice="reconcile-stall-guard" data-rev="0">
  <!-- Body-only fragment: page chrome (heading, metric-row, topology figure) is renderer-owned. -->
  <style>
    .fragment-plan .pl-guard-compare { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin: 14px 0; }
    .fragment-plan .pl-guard-compare .pl-col { border: 1px solid var(--border, #d0d4da); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 12px; }
    .fragment-plan .pl-col h4 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: .02em; }
    .fragment-plan .pl-col.pl-bad h4 { color: var(--danger, #b3261e); }
    .fragment-plan .pl-col.pl-good h4 { color: var(--success, #1b7f4d); }
    .fragment-plan .pl-col pre { margin: 0; font-size: 0.75rem; overflow-x: auto; }
    .fragment-plan .pl-note { font-size: 0.8rem; opacity: .85; margin: 4px 0 0; }
    @media (max-width: 640px) { .fragment-plan .pl-guard-compare { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  </style>

  <div class="pl-guard-compare">
    <div class="pl-col pl-bad">
      <h4>Shipped guard — misfires on full pages</h4>
      <pre>if (chunk.size == prevChunkSize) break
// page1: 20 rows → prev = 20
// page2: 20 DIFFERENT rows → 20 == 20
// → "no progress", sweep aborts</pre>
      <p class="pl-note">Live probe: 30 of 50 never-backed-up articles left stranded after one chunk.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pl-col pl-good">
      <h4>Planned guard — full-chunk identity + cap</h4>
      <pre>val ids = chunk.mapTo(mutableSetOf()) { it.itemId }
if (ids == prevChunkIds) break   // same rows = true stall
prevChunkIds = ids
if (++iterations > MAX_RECONCILE_ITERATIONS) break</pre>
      <p class="pl-note">Stalls only when stamping stops removing rows; 1000-iteration cap as independent failsafe (AC2).</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <table class="files-touched">
